Z||000000||Fiero86||08-08-2000||12:10 AM||||I have a 1986 Fiero with a kit on it. I really would like to know what model Fiero I have, but it doesn't say it anywhere on the car. I know its a 4cylinder engine. Can anyone help me? Please email me, because I am not sure how to check messages on this. Thanks soo much!<P>Falconwreslr@aol.com<BR><P>------------------<BR>Fiero Fan<BR>Falconwreslr@aol.com||||reg||5
Z||000001||Carrolles||08-08-2000||12:17 AM||||Since it is a 4 cyl it is probably an SC (Sport Coupe) although it could be an SE. I'm not sure if any 86 SEs had 4 cyl engines.<P> There is a sticker under the front hood on the driver's side inner fender that lists all the option codes.  There should be a code that identifies your model.  Someone else can probably identify the codes for you.<P>Good luck,<P>Carroll||||reg||1
