Z||000004||DJRice||08-08-2000||11:32 AM||||Ive seen an 86SE with the 4 banger.<P>Get the VIN number off of the car and go to  <A HREF="http://www.fiero.net" TARGET=_blank>www.fiero.net</A> .  Then click on VIN decoder.  That should answer a couple of your quesitons. <P>------------------<BR>Dillon - Titusville, FL<BR>Black '87 SE V6<BR>"Matched Perfect and Staggered Special"||||reg||1
